 remaining black square eye near the screen-left face edge, broad terracotta facet along screen-right, and the left keyboard contact shifted one logical block left.\n+\n+Diagonals interpolate these strong cardinal face families evenly. A side direction may show one eye because the other is naturally occluded by the blocky face turn; never add new eye whites, round eyes, or replacement eyes. These face changes must be visible at normal pet size and must lead the body language, rather than relying on a tiny pupil shift.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/zenray/Create/Build/Memory/_TEMP/hatch-pet-runs/clawd-coder-c-20260713/qa/look-mechanics.md\n"},"completed_at_ms":1783935389092}}
